    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "ENGINE 2 FEEDER \u2014 IDEA ENGINE\nTops up the 'queue' tab with fresh, specific topics when it runs low. The AI-generated workflow consumes these. Fully autonomous \u2014 no manual calendar.",
